The decision that unblocks everything is yours: rerun this as a refresh of the existing Markiplier page, or confirm a separate legal-name page with a plan that keeps the two from disagreeing on type. I'd rerun as the Markiplier refresh, since readers search that name and one URL should carry one reading.
